cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "A Lean 4 formalization of Deng–Hani's long time justification of wave turbulence theory"
abstract: "A formal proof, checked by the Lean 4 proof assistant, of Theorem 1.1 of Y. Deng and Z. Hani, Long time justification of wave turbulence theory (arXiv:2311.10082), for the full range 0 < γ < 1 on the square torus."
